  "landingAboutTitle": "The Tactical Assistant for Modern Coaches",
  "landingAboutContent": "VolleyPlan is more than just a training calendar — it's a complete tactical dashboard for modern volleyball coaches. Say goodbye to juggling between Excel, WhatsApp, and scattered notebooks. Our platform centralizes everything: technical and physical training cycles, position-based roster management, automatic performance reports, and one-click professional PDF export. Whether you coach a national team, a regional club, or a youth squad, VolleyPlan adapts to your reality and helps you bring your team to peak form on competition day.",
  "landingHowTitle": "In 5 simple steps",
  "landingHowStep1Title": "Roster",
  "landingHowStep1Desc": "Import your players, assign their positions (setter, libero, middle blocker, outside hitter) and build a structured roster. Your squad management is centralized and ready in under five minutes.",
  "landingHowStep2Title": "Planning",
  "landingHowStep2Desc": "Create training cycles in Group or Position-Specific mode. Define sessions, exercises, and game areas (serving, attacking, defense, fitness) — VolleyPlan structures your entire preparation from start to finish.",
  "landingHowStep3Title": "Analysis",
  "landingHowStep3Desc": "View in real time the distribution of your training volume by game area across the entire season. Automated reports instantly alert you if reception, defense, or fitness are underrepresented in your cycle.",
  "landingHowStep4Title": "Action",
  "landingHowStep4Desc": "In a single click, generate a professional PDF of your complete schedule. Share it instantly via WhatsApp or email — your players receive their program without needing to download anything.",
  "landingHowStep5Title": "Collaboration",
  "landingHowStep5Desc": "Invite your assistant coaches or fitness trainers to a specific schedule. They can access, view, and edit sessions from their own account in real time. Zero file transfers, 100% coordination.",
  "landingWhyTitle": "The Ultimate Solution",
  "landingWhySubtitle": "Designed for those who lead, loved by those who play.",
  "landingWhyCoachHeading": "FOR COACHES 👨‍💼",
  "landingWhyPlayerHeading": "FOR PLAYERS 🏃‍♂️",
  "landingWhyCoach1Title": "Massive time saving",
  "landingWhyCoach1Desc": "Save up to 5 hours per week on creating, updating, and communicating your training cycles. That time saved means more energy invested in on-field observation and real coaching of your athletes.",
  "landingWhyCoach2Title": "Tactical Precision",
  "landingWhyCoach2Desc": "Cumulative graphic reports across the entire season alert you the moment you underinvest in a key area — defense, reception, or fitness. Every planning decision becomes data-driven, not just intuition.",
  "landingWhyPlayer1Title": "Absolute clarity",
  "landingWhyPlayer1Desc": "No more uncertainty or last-minute improvisation. Each player receives a clear, professional PDF schedule directly on their smartphone via WhatsApp — with no account to create and no app to install.",
  "landingWhyPlayer2Title": "Linear progression",
  "landingWhyPlayer2Desc": "An athlete who knows exactly what their upcoming sessions contain trains with greater intensity and purpose. VolleyPlan promotes measurable and consistent progression across the entire season.",
  "landingGuideTitle": "User Guide",
  "landingGuideSubtitle": "Discover the app in action in less than two minutes.",
  "landingTestimonialsTitle": "They dominate the court with us",
  "landingTestimonial1Quote": "« Before VolleyPlan, my pre-competition nights were a battlefield of Excel sheets, WhatsApp messages, and scattered papers. Now I build my monthly cycle in under an hour, export a clean PDF, and my players receive their schedule straight to their phones. A game-changer for any club coach. »",
  "landingTestimonial1Author": "Coach Marc, Regional Division — Yaoundé",
  "landingTestimonial2Quote": "« Receiving the detailed program before arriving at the gym changes everything. I know exactly what areas we're working on, the expected intensity at serve and block. I'm mentally ready well before the first whistle. »",
  "landingTestimonial2Author": "Youssouf, Outside Hitter",
  "landingTestimonial3Quote": "« What I love is the big picture view across the whole season. In one glance, the automatic reports showed me I was over-investing in serving at the expense of reception. I adjusted my program and our competition results clearly improved. »",
  "landingTestimonial3Author": "Coach Amine, National Club — Douala",
  "landingTestimonial4Quote": "« I use VolleyPlan with my fitness trainer. He integrates the strength and cardio sessions directly into our shared technical schedule. Our staff coordination has never been smoother, and the players see the difference on the court. »",
  "landingTestimonial4Author": "Coach Élise, National Technical Director",
  "landingFaqTitle": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "landingFaq1Q": "Is the app free?",
  "landingFaq1A": "Yes, with no hidden fees. The current version lets you fully configure your roster, design technical and physical training cycles, analyze performance reports, and export your schedules to PDF — all completely free, with no session limits.",
  "landingFaq2Q": "Do my players need to create an account?",
  "landingFaq2A": "Not at all. That's one of VolleyPlan's biggest strengths. Only the coach uses the platform. Your players simply receive a clear, professional PDF directly on WhatsApp or by email — with no account to create and no app to install.",
  "landingFaq3Q": "How does VolleyPlan help track progression across a season?",
  "landingFaq3A": "VolleyPlan generates automatic cumulative reports across all your schedules. At a glance, you can visualize your training volume distribution by game area (serving, reception, attack, defense, fitness) and identify imbalances to correct. It's a full-season dashboard, updated with every new session.",
  "landingFaq4Q": "Can I collaborate with my staff members on a schedule?",
  "landingFaq4A": "Yes! VolleyPlan includes a collaboration module that lets you invite assistant coaches or fitness trainers to a specific schedule. They access it through their own phone and can view or edit sessions in real time. No more sharing files over WhatsApp — everything happens inside the app.",
  "landingFaq5Q": "Can I export schedules in PDF format?",
  "landingFaq5A": "Absolutely. With a single click, VolleyPlan generates a professional, readable PDF of your complete schedule — sessions, exercises, game areas, and timings. The document is instantly shareable via WhatsApp, email, or any other channel. Your players receive their program directly on their smartphones, no account needed.",
  "landingCtaTitle": "Ready to structure your season?",
  "landingCtaSubtitle": "Join the coaches who trust VolleyPlan to structure their training.",
  "landingFooterSlogan": "Propel your team to the top.",
